  "description": "Herbert & Lansdowne are delighted to present this beautiful one bedroom fourth floor apartment to the rental market.\n\nThis spacious apartment has superb views and comprises an entrance hallway, a bright and spacious living room with enclosed balcony off same, fully equipped kitchen with integrated appliances, large double bedroom with built in wardrobes and an enclosed balcony off same and a fully tiled main bathroom.\n\nThe property comes with one underground car parking space and has underfloor heating.\n\nElm Park is an environmentally sustainable, residential and commercial development situated in an outstanding part of Dublin 4 located close to the DART line. The development has beautiful views of Dublin Bay and Elm Park Golf Club.",
